{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Clione's Bomb-Bomb Sweeper",
    "steam_appid": 3326650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clione's Bomb-Bomb Sweeper&quot; is an action puzzle game featuring Clione, the younger brother-in-law of Pirarucu, who appears in &quot;Goonya Monster.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly transported to a mysterious passageway, Clione finds himself in danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive blocks roll forward, and the path behind crumbles over time?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a major crisis! Using his Shooter, Clione must break through the blocks and push forward step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Break Blocks Boldly, But Carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Destroying a bomb-containing block means game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Use the numbers displayed on the ground to help avoid bombs and clear the path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Activate the Universal Sweeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 When the gauge is full, the Shooter powers up, and the Universal Sweeper activates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Without fear of bombs, sweep through all blocks and advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Use Items Wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Items can sometimes be found in the passage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 They include items that &quot;reveal bombs,&quot; &quot;generate a large number of Souls,&quot; and &quot;instantly fill the gauge.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Organize Your Thoughts with Bomb Checks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 If you think a block looks suspicious, mark it with a check to help guess bomb locations!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clione's Bomb-Bomb Sweeper&quot; is an action puzzle game featuring Clione, the younger brother-in-law of Pirarucu, who appears in &quot;Goonya Monster.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly transported to a mysterious passageway, Clione finds himself in danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive blocks roll forward, and the path behind crumbles over time?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a major crisis! Using his Shooter, Clione must break through the blocks and push forward step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Break Blocks Boldly, But Carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Destroying a bomb-containing block means game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Use the numbers displayed on the ground to help avoid bombs and clear the path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Activate the Universal Sweeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 When the gauge is full, the Shooter powers up, and the Universal Sweeper activates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Without fear of bombs, sweep through all blocks and advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Use Items Wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Items can sometimes be found in the passage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 They include items that &quot;reveal bombs,&quot; &quot;generate a large number of Souls,&quot; and &quot;instantly fill the gauge.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Organize Your Thoughts with Bomb Checks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 If you think a block looks suspicious, mark it with a check to help guess bomb locations!</p>",
    "short_description": "A spin-off from the asymmetric party action game &quot;Goonya Monster,&quot; with character designs by Terada Tera! Break through the oncoming blocks and advance! This is a fresh, exhilarating puzzle action game that fuses bomb puzzles with unique &quot;Goonya Monster&quot; action!",
